{"name":"v04_CD3_27 - Paranoya - Geo-Mechanica","date":"2001-07-02T11:19:30.000Z","clearFrame":false,"components":[{"type":"Comment","group":"Misc","text":"After some weeks of a complete lack of inspiration, I finnally can say I'm back with a new piece of AVS art. \r\nWell the theme in this one is as you can see geometric figures. I made some with the movement and the scopes. This one uses an updated version of my morphing algorithm I desgined for the my Speed Merchant preset. I also implemented this morphing into the dynamic movement, which is now steadyly morphing between some nice geometric shapes, zooming in and out on them according to the beat. The scope is also morphing between some geometric shapes and some \"regular\" angular and normal scopes.\r\n\r\nI hope you'll like this one otherwise stay tuned for some more cool AVS-stuff.\r\n\r\nGreetingzz\r\n\r\nParaNoya\r\n\r\n(parajunk@icqmail.com)\r\n02-07-2001\r\n======================================================\r\nMaking you not believe your eyes, is what I do best!"},{"type":"SetRenderMode","group":"Misc","blend":"ADDITIVE","adjustBlend":0,"lineSize":1,"enabled":true},{"type":"FyrewurX","group":"Misc","enabled":true},{"type":"SuperScope","group":"Render","code":{"init":"n=200","perFrame":"n=if(equal(red+blue+green,0),0,200);","onBeat":"bc=bc+1;","perPoint":"x=if(above(bc%8,3),(if(above(i,0.5),-(i*2-1),i*2-1)+0.5)*2,i*2-1);\r\ny=v/2+if(above(bc%8,3),if(above(i,0.5),0.5,-0.5),0)"},"audioChannel":"CENTER","audioSource":"WAVEFORM","colors":["#404080","#404080","#000000","#000000","#000000","#804040","#804040","#000000","#000000","#000000"],"drawMode":"LINES"},{"type":"FyrewurX","group":"Misc","enabled":true},{"type":"MovingParticle","group":"Render","enabled":true,"onBeatSizeChange":true,"color":"#804040","distance":32,"particleSize":2,"onBeatParticleSize":21,"blendMode":"Additive"},{"type":"MovingParticle","group":"Render","enabled":true,"onBeatSizeChange":true,"color":"#488040","distance":32,"particleSize":2,"onBeatParticleSize":21,"blendMode":"Additive"},{"type":"MovingParticle","group":"Render","enabled":true,"onBeatSizeChange":true,"color":"#408080","distance":32,"particleSize":2,"onBeatParticleSize":20,"blendMode":"Additive"},{"type":"SuperScope","group":"Render","code":{"init":"n=200;pi=acos(-1);cnt=1;fr=-3.14;bc=0;bc2=0;ap=1","perFrame":"cnt=if(band(equal((fr*100)%314,0),bnot(equal((fr*100)%628,0))),rand(4)+1,cnt);st=if(band(equal((fr*100)%314,0),below(bc,7)),0,1);fr=if(equal(fr,7*3.14),-3.14,fr+0.02*st);a1=if(equal(cnt,1),cos(fr)/2+0.5,0);a2=if(equal(cnt,2),cos(fr)/2+0.5,0);a3=if(equal(cnt,3),cos(fr)/2+0.5,0);a4=if(equal(cnt,4),cos(fr)/2+0.5,0);t=t-0.05;f=f+0.02;","onBeat":"bc=if(st,0,bc+1);bc2=bc2+1;ap=if(equal(bc2%4,0),rand(6)+1,ap);h=rand(5);k=pow(-1,h);","perPoint":"i=(a1+a2)*(pow(sin(i),ap)*atan(i-t)*4*sign(cos(t))+cos(t)*sin(i-f))+(a3+a4)*i-(a1+a2+a3+a4-1)*i*pi*2;\r\nv=a1*v/1.5+(a2+a3)*v/30+a4*v/20-(a1+a2+a3+a4-1)*v/4;\r\nr=(a1+a2)*(sin(i)*pi-sin(f));\r\nx=a1*(cos(i+t-r%f)+cos(t-r))+a2*(pow(-1,ap)*(sin(i+t)+sin(f-r))+getspec(r,cos(t)*2,i))+a3*((if(below(i,0.25),i,if(below(i,0.5),0.25-v,if(below(i,0.75),-i+0.75,0-v))))*4-0.5)+a4*((if(below(i,0.33),i,if(below(i,0.66),-i*0.5+v+0.5,i*-0.5+v+0.5)))*4-0.66)-(a1+a2+a3+a4-1)*(cos(i)/2+v*cos(i)/2);\r\ny=a1*(sin(i+v)+sin(t-f/2))+a2*(cos(i-v)+(cos(t)-0.5)*atan(r-f-sin(t)))+a3*((if(below(i,0.25),0-v,if(below(i,0.5),i-0.25,if(below(i,0.75),0.25+v,-i+1))))*4-0.5)+k*a4*((if(below(i,0.33),0+v,if(below(i,0.66),-i*0.5+0.33/2,i*0.5-0.5)))*4+0.33/2)-(a1+a2+a3+a4-1)*(sin(i)+(v-1)*sin(i)/2);"},"audioChannel":"CENTER","audioSource":"WAVEFORM","colors":["#ff5555","#ffaa55","#ffff55","#aaff55","#aaff55","#55ff55","#55ffaa","#55ffff","#55aaff","#5555ff","#aa55ff","#ff55ff","#ff55aa","#000000"],"drawMode":"LINES"},{"type":"DynamicMovement","group":"Trans","code":{"init":"cnt=1;fr=-3.14;bc=0;st=1;pi=acos(-1);i=1","perFrame":"cnt=if(band(equal((fr*100)%314,0),bnot(equal((fr*100)%628,0))),rand(4)+1,cnt);\r\nst=if(band(equal((fr*100)%314,0),below(bc,5)),0,1);fr=if(equal(fr,7*3.14),-3.14,fr+0.02*st);\r\na1=if(equal(cnt,1),cos(fr)/2+0.5,0);a2=if(equal(cnt,2),cos(fr)/2+0.5,0);a3=if(equal(cnt,3),cos(fr)/2+0.5,0);a4=if(equal(cnt,4),cos(fr)/2+0.5,0);\r\nt=t+0.05;\r\ne=cos(t)/4+0.5;\r\n","onBeat":"bc=if(st,0,bc+1);\r\nbc2=bc2+1;\r\nh=if(bnot(bc2%3),rand(10),h);\r\nk=pow(-1,h);\r\ni=if(bnot(bc2%4),2,if(bnot(bc2%2),0.5,1));\r\n","perPoint":"d=if(band(band(below(k*y,x*2+0.75),below(-k*y,0.75)),below(k*y,-x*2+0.75)),sin(d),-cos(d))*a1\r\n+if(band(band(band(above(x,-e),above(y,-e)),below(x,e)),below(y,e)),sin(d),-d)*a2\r\n+if(band(band(above(-y,k*x/2-0.375*i),above(k*x,-0.75)),below(-y,-k*x/2+0.375*i)),sin(d),-cos(d))*a3\r\n+if(band(band(band(above(-y,-x-0.75*i),above(-y,x-0.75*i)),below(-y,x+0.75*i)),below(-y,-x+0.75*i)),sin(d),-cos(d))*a4\r\n-(tan(d)*e-(e-1)*sin(d)*cos(d))*(a1+a2+a3+a4-1);\r\nr=r+sin(t)/10"},"bFilter":true,"coord":"POLAR","gridW":26,"gridH":26,"blend":true,"wrap":false,"buffer":0,"alphaOnly":false},{"type":"Blur","group":"Trans","blur":"MEDIUM"},{"type":"BlitterFeedback","group":"Misc","zoom":30,"onBeatZoom":43,"blendMode":"REPLACE","onBeat":"true","bilinear":false},{"type":"FadeOut","group":"Trans","speed":1,"color":"#000000"}]}